review_text:
Person sitting on a bench floating above a table;
an innkeeper leaning on the table while the innkeeper cleans, and both of them passing through each other's bodies;
wagons that don't stop when you're standing on the road and push you aside even when you're on your horse;
items that respawn even though you've already picked them up;
villagers who can't pass when there's a wagon in the middle of the road and keep bumping into it;
no one bothers to look back to see what you're doing behind them or if they'll be robbed;
characters who stand in the same place for too long day after day, such as at the camp;
Cumans, after interactions, stand in the same place day after day;
sword combos are impossible to perform using a computer mouse;
you can stand over people sleeping and they don't mind;
phrases repeated too frequently while you roll dice;
Henry made a big deal with cutscenes and emotion about losing his dog and finding his horse was no big deal, that was stupid...

I just arrived in Kuttenberg so there are probably still a lot of bugs that I will report.
